Properties of the hypervisor MD
-------------------------------
Per property:
    value        in legion (pci differs only where said)
    required     whether the hypervisor needs it
    read at      where the hypervisor reads it
    T1-archive   whether the archive has it
    T2-archive   (configs/) whether the archive has it
    note

root.content-version
    value                  0x100000000
    required               yes
    read at                reconf.c:124 (the major version must equal
                           HV_MDCONT_VER_MAJOR, else the hypervisor aborts)
    T1-archive             -
    T2-archive             configs/*_hv.desc
    note                   major << 32 | minor, 1.0 (config.h:98-99). The guest
                           MD's property of this name is the string "1" (FWARC
                           2005/115).

root.stick-frequency
    value                  100000000
    required               yes
    read at                reconf.c:171
    T1-archive             -
    T2-archive             configs/*_hv.desc (another value: 1000000000)
    note                   The tick rate QEMU provides. Ours: configs/*_hv.desc
                           use the FPGA's, 1000000000 (T1_FPGA_STICK_FREQ).

root.hvuart
    value                  0xfff0c2c000
    required               yes
    read at                reconf.c:150
    T1-archive             legion/common.hdesc (HVUART)
    T2-archive             configs/*_hv.desc (same value: T1_FPGA_UART_BASE)
    note                   An address.

root.tod
    value                  0xfff0c1fff8
    required               yes
    read at                reconf.c:162
    T1-archive             legion/common.hdesc (HVTOD)
    T2-archive             configs/*_hv.desc (another value: 0)
    note                   An address; QEMU NIAGARA_RTC_BASE is the same.

platform.stick-frequency
    value                  100000000
    required               unread
    read at                -
    T1-archive             -
    T2-archive             configs/*_hv.desc (another value: 1000000000)
    note                   The hypervisor reads the root's.

guest.resource_id
    value                  0
    required               yes
    read at                res_guest.c:198, 251
    T1-archive             -
    T2-archive             configs/*_hv.desc
    note                   An index below NGUESTS (res_guest.c:198-206).

guest.mdpa
    value                  0x1f12000000
    required               yes
    read at                res_guest.c:255, reconf.c:1272
    T1-archive             1up.conf, 1g2p.hdesc (pdpa; the same address)
    T2-archive             configs/*_hv.desc (another value: 0xfff00f0000)
    note                   The guest MD's load address; QEMU
                           NIAGARA_MD_ROM_BASE.

guest.rombase
    value                  0xfff0080000
    required               yes
    read at                res_guest.c:252, reconf.c:1206
    T1-archive             legion/common.hdesc (ROMBASE)
    T2-archive             configs/*_hv.desc (same value: ROMBASE of
                           xilinx_t1_system_config.h)
    note                   Where the hypervisor copies the OpenBoot image from
                           (greatlakes/*/main.s, "Copy guest's firmware image");
                           QEMU puts openboot.bin there.

guest.romsize
    value                  0x80000 (512k)
    required               yes
    read at                res_guest.c:253, reconf.c:1207
    T1-archive             legion/common.hdesc (ROMSIZE)
    T2-archive             configs/*_hv.desc (another value: 0x70000)
    note                   Bytes copied; must not exceed the guest's base mblock
                           (res_guest.c, HVctl_e_guest_base_mblock_too_small).

guest.diskpa
    value                  0x1f40000000
    required               only with CONFIG_DISK
    read at                res_guest.c:265, reconf.c:1278
    T1-archive             1up.conf, 1g2p.hdesc (the same address)
    T2-archive             configs/*_hv.desc (another value: 0xfff1000000)
